    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75892" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔνης:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλέπτης, κλεπτῶν συνηφαρεία</span> (sic), <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔνιος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖνις, δρομεύς, κλέπτης</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔνομα</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐνομάζω</span></b> , etc., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
