				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα, ὀνομάζω</span>
			, etc. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖνον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγιές. Κύπριοι δρόμον</span>,
		Id.</div>
